  "description": "Ruleset canonical-hash vectors (docs/battle-protocol.md §F, §H). Generated by protocol/scripts/gen-vectors.ts from protocol/src/ruleset. A ruleset hash is chain-agnostic on purpose: the same rules can run on either chain. A failure means the implementation drifted. Never edit an expectation to match new output.",
